WEBVTT

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:19.160
Merry Christmas!

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.380
Hey...

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:55.380
Why do we have to put up decorations for Christmas?

00:01:55.380 --> 00:02:00.850
I think she wants to cash in on the Christmas spirit or somethin'.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.260
Yes, you're right.

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:06.260
We use what we can.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:08.020
That's how you do business.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.690
You're just greedy.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:10.680
What!?

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:14.200
Who made me like this in the first place!?

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.210
What?

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:16.440
Calm down, calm down.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.220
It doesn't really matter.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:21.240
Christmas is a happy time.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.850
That's my Hadzuki.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:25.090
You need to learn from her.

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:27.080
Hey, where's Pop today?

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:31.040
Well, she's kind of busy so she's not coming for a few days.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:32.400
Eh?

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.000
What's there for her to be busy for?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.920
Who wants to meet Santa this year?

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.380
We do!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:43.680
Okay, Santa Search Squad, move out!

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.090
Yeah!

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:53.280
Save Santa!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:02.380
I wonder if we can find the real Santa this year.

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:03.450
We'll be fine.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.910
I have a secret to tell you all.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.310
What is it?

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:10.560
Do you know how Santa figures out what we want?

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:12.360
How?

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:16.340
He sneaks into town and secretly investigates all of us.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.190
I see.

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:20.970
Then we can find him if we look hard enough?

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:23.770
Yep!

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:27.180
Recess is over, so let's get going!

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.010
Yeah!

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.710
Let's find Santa!

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.150
Where are you, Santa?

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:35.200
We'll be going now.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.280
Thank you.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.450
Later.

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.180
The streets are fulla Christmas spirit.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.720
Look, look!

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:46.420
It's so pretty!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:51.660
Santa Claus is okay, but I like cakes and steak better.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.550
That...

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.930
Segawa Onpu's Mini Concert?

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.130
It's a good way to attract people to this shopping district.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:05.230
A lot of people will come to the concert, so the stores will get more people.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:06.900
Oh, I see!

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:07.930
Hey, hey.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:12.600
If the three of us sing at the Maho-dou, we may get more customers!

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.560
No good.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.510
I knew it.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.480
Yeah, you're right.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.550
Doremi-chan.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:26.120
Mister, you okay?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.070
I'm fine.

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.250
I'm sorry.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.640
I'm fine, I'm fine. Thank you.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.330
I'm really sorry.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:41.070
It's okay.

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:43.840
Doremi-chan, be more careful.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.430
Sorry, sorry.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.470
Mister!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.190
This is yours, right?

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.020
It would be bad if I had lost that.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:01.110
Thank you.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.170
Well then.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.070
Is he really okay?

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.760
Let's find Santa!

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:11.520
Where are you, Santa?

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.410
Let's find Santa!

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.150
Where are you, Santa?

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:16.910
Let's find Santa!

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:18.740
Where are you, Santa?

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:19.880
Let's find...

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:20.500
Stop!

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:23.170
Doremi!

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:26.920
Jeez, you told me you were busy and couldn't come to the Maho-dou,

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.340
so just what are you doing?

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.310
We're looking for Santa.

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:32.970
Santa?

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:37.640
We have something that we must tell Santa!

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:38.900
Yes!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.520
Santa won't be wandering around on the streets like this!

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:44.360
You won't find him!

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.660
W-What is it?

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.820
We will definitely find him.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.080
Let's go.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.320
Let's find Santa!

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.020
Where are you, Santa?

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:58.840
Let's find Santa!

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.480
Where are you, Santa?

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:02.340
Let's find Santa!

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.130
What are they doing?
Where are you, Santa?

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:10.700
So boring...

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:11.730
Yes, so boring.

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.140
So boring.

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:16.240
So, have you found anything?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.440
What?

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.940
I see Onpu-chan!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:25.480
Eh? Where, where?

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:26.190
Over there!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.170
Ah, you're right!

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:30.610
Hey!

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:31.580
Let's go!

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:35.160
What about Santa?

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.190
It's the real deal!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:38.710
Wow!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.890
Onpu-chan is looking right at us!

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:45.600
What do we do!? This is bad!

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:46.120
Oh?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.970
Pop-chan.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.840
Yo.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:53.800
Are you all here to watch my concert?

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.100
No, we're looking for Santa.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.560
Santa?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.520
Yes, Santa.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:01.780
Let's go.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:03.300
Okay.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:08.990
Santa... Are they talking about <i>that </i> Santa?

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:11.950
We're done!

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:17.790
What's wrong, Doremi-chan?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.050
Somethin's wrong with that guy!

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:22.960
Yeah.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.640
What's wrong?

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:25.920
Are you okay?

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.340
It's the old man from yesterday!

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.350
What happened?

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.290
What's wrong?

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.330
Make yourself clear!

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.360
You're a Witch Frog, right?

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.300
Don't tell me you're...

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.560
Santa Claus?

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.550
Santa Claus?

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:17.940
Here.

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:19.220
Thank you.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:22.460
I can't believe there's a Santa who's so slim.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:24.230
Yer a bit different from what I had imagined.

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:27.910
But how did you get so skinny?

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:29.980
I've come down with a severe cold.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.180
That's why you didn't look too good.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:36.400
But since it's Christmas, I still have to work.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:41.620
I spent an entire year finding out what the children want.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:44.280
Hence, my list.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:48.420
Now all I have to do is deliver the presents.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.670
Be careful!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.010
You can't do it when you're this weak!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:55.850
Yeah! Tonight's Christmas Eve!

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.720
Ya can't give out presents like this!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:01.180
I have to go no matter what.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:03.290
Santa...

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:05.490
I understand.

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:06.980
We'll help you.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.460
Okay, can we do that, Majo Rika?

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.550
All right, get going.

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:37.130
But in exchange...

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.820
I need a present.

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:45.560
I want a present.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.330
R-Right...

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:48.520
But yer so old already...

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:51.960
Age doesn't matter in wanting presents!

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.230
Be honest here.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:56.880
But we're having steak tonight!

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.950
I have to eat dinner with my family too...

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.960
Me too!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.490
Don't worry.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:06.930
I give out presents after the children are asleep.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:07.960
You can go home first.

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:09.960
Okay!

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:19.380
We didn't find him, that Santa.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:20.510
Yeah...

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.260
I thought I'd definitely get to meet him.

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:28.060
Ohh? So Santa really exists.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:28.980
Yes!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.520
But he's not feeling very well...

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.950
So we're helpin' him deliver all the presents!

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.320
Can you help us out, Onpu-chan?

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:37.820
Sure.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:39.330
Really?

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.410
I'd like to...

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:45.700
But I need to be in this concert. And I have an interview after.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.190
Onpu-chan, it's time!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.610
Coming!

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:50.850
Sorry about that!

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:53.290
I knew it'd be useless...

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:55.510
Looks like we hafta do it ourselves.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:56.550
Yeah.

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.510
What's this!?

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:02.970
Steak made from chicken.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:08.530
It's delicious too, even if it's not beef.

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:10.580
You're right, but...

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:18.900
No way!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.100
You saw Santa!?

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:25.630
Yep, and he wants us to help him give out presents.

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:27.120
Let me go too!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.210
Please, bring me along!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:34.080
Please, please, please!

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:38.700
Are you really begging me with that attitude of yours!?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.360
Please, Doremi.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:46.750
I have to see Santa this year. I have to tell him something.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.430
I understand.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:53.480
But to do that... you can't fall asleep.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:54.500
Okay!

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.660
And of course, she's asleep.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.700
Hey, Pop, let's go.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.580
I'll never, ever, try to wake her up again.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.420
Are you okay?

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:13.330
Gotta be Pop-chan again.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.160
Well then, let's go.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:28.700
Now then, three little witches, let us depart.

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:34.970
Okay!

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:40.340
So pretty!

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:41.690
Yeah.

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:43.930
Where are we going?

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:47.870
You'll see it soon.

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:50.450
Over there! That's it.

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:54.210
That's the Land of Santa.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.220
Hey, hey, what's going on?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.750
There are so many Santas!

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:15.260
There are many more places like this throughout the entire world.

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:18.970
These are only the Santas that look over Misora City.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:23.040
What's that thing that looks like an elephant?

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:25.290
It's the present maker.

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:27.200
Present maker?

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.070
Something seems wrong.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:31.950
What happened?

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.150
It's terrible!

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:36.500
The present maker is malfunctioning!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.070
What did you say?

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:40.000
Santa!

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.820
Can you fix it?

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:48.390
It's useless.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.970
We can't get it moving.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:53.930
No way...

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:58.640
We worked so hard just for this day...

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:03.070
Will the children not get presents this year?

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:08.360
They are all waiting for their presents...

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.930
You can't just give up!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:14.500
We may be able to do something about it.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:15.200
Yeah!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.410
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:28.010
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:33.110
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.630
Magical Stage!

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.740
Help the Santas!

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:07.800
It's moving again!

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:11.010
Yes!

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:15.050
Go! Time is running out!

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:15.970
Yeah!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:22.520
We're running out of time. Can you help us organize the presents?

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.700
Leave it to us!

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:28.190
We used up all of our magic spheres!

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:33.580
Good job on the concert.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:39.200
Mama has to do a bit more work for you, so I'll be home late.

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:42.150
Papa is working the night shift again.

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:47.450
Sorry, but please enjoy the microwaved dinner without us.

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:49.160
Merry Christmas.

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:52.930
Merry Christmas... huh?

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.430
Can you help us out, Onpu-chan?

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:07.520
Okay, that's the last batch, keep going!

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:12.130
If we could use magic, we'd be done by now!

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.910
You just have to put the presents in the bags, right?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:22.160
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:25.290
Put the presents in the bags!

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:41.750
Onpu-chan!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:44.610
I thought it'd be kind of fun to check out the Land of Santa.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.600
Onpu-chan!

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.270
You saved us!

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:51.320
Ya came in just the nick of time.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.170
Thank you, Onpu-chan.

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:55.450
Are you doing okay at work?

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:58.600
Yes, I had a bit of free time.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:01.910
Little witches.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:05.500
Could you help us give out the presents?

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:07.420
Yes!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:27.100
Well then, we'll be going!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.060
It's in your hands, now.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.610
Okay!

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:48.080
This is the last one.

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:50.500
She's sleeping so soundly.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:54.680
Jeez, I won't wake you up ever again!

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:58.330
It's your fault that you couldn't see Santa. Haha!

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:00.930
Santa...

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.380
Santa...

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.900
Jeez, Pop, you idiot.

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:17.160
Doremi-chan, we're all done here.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.520
How about you?

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:27.080
Um... I have something to ask Santa.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.490
What is it?

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.340
Um...

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:35.180
My sister, Pop, wants to meet Santa no matter what.

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:37.510
Can you go see her?

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:43.470
It's forbidden for Santa to meet children.

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:46.890
I can give up my own present this year!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.070
I'll give mine up too!

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.670
It's fer Pop-chan!

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:56.060
Me too! Majo Rika's present too!

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:58.780
Me too.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:00.950
I'll give mine up too.

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:03.050
Girls...

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:05.120
I understand.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:10.120
I can't meet her, but...

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:22.260
Where is Santa?

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.930
Let's find Santa!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.650
Where is Santa?

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:27.300
Let's find Santa!

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:29.210
Where is Santa?

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:30.350
I'm right here.

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:35.680
Were you all good?

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:38.400
Are you really Santa?

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:40.360
Yes.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.430
Um...

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:48.880
We have something we have to tell you.

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:50.790
What could it be?

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.790
Ready, go!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:58.760
Santa, thank you for the presents!

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:04.680
And thank <i>you</i>.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.720
You cute children.

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:21.880
Santa...

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.840
We finally meet.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.040
Thank you, Santa.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:39.770
Us too.

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:41.970
You really helped us out.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.320
We had a lot of fun.

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.380
Yeah!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:57.940
Everyone, thank you for helping out Santa Claus.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:03.400
You made it possible for the dreams of children everywhere to come true.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:07.280
Now, here is a present.

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.300
It's a sphere of certification.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:18.000
I look forward to your continued progress.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.960
Thank you very much, Your Majesty!

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.300
Thank you very much!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:27.110
And with that, Merry Christmas, one and all.

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:32.650
Merry Christmas, Your Majesty!

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:38.900
This is the best Christmas present.

00:21:42.930 --> 00:21:44.120
It's snow!

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:45.650
It's starting to snow!

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:49.970
It's a white Christmas this year too.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:51.300
Yep.

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:57.070
I hope tomorrow will be covered in a beautiful layer of snow.

00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:04.290
Ladies and Gentlemen!

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:07.720
Welcome to Misora Magic Show!

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:09.990
I'm your MC, Senoo!

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:11.700
I'm your assistant, Fujiwara!

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:16.920
And our master magician is the one you've all been waiting for!

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:18.410
Yes, the one and only,

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:20.750
Nichiaki Watabe!

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:22.860
Eh? It's not me?

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:24.020
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:25.810
The Witches' Talent Show!

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:28.580
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
